Apple today added the iPad mini with the A17 Pro chip to its refurbished store <a href="https://www.apple.com/shop/refurbished/ipad/ipad-mini">in the U.S.</a> and <a href="https://www.apple.com/ca/shop/refurbished/ipad/ipad-mini">Canada</a> for the first time since the device was released in October 2024. Other key features include an 8.3-inch display, a 12-megapixel Center Stage camera, and a Touch ID power button. There is no availability in any other countries yet.<br/>
<br/>
